== Description ==

Bankers are found in the major cities throughout Norrath, offering adventurers access to their stored items within the Norrath banking exchange.
In '''EverQuest Legends''', bankers grant players access to several new bank vaults.

The default player back comes with slots for 16 items or containers.  There is no shared bank, but there are separate banks for Shrouds, Dragon's Hoard, and Tradeskil Depot.

